[{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0409","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0409.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3904","title":"Linux Kernel RDS 协议本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.6.36 之前版本中 Reliable Datagram Sockets（RDS）协议的 rds_page_copy_user 函数未正确验证用户空间传入的内存地址，本地攻击者可通过精心构造 sendmsg 和 recvmsg 系统调用触发此漏洞，实现权限提升至 root。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响内核版本的 Linux 发行版，攻击者需拥有本地用户权限即可利用，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3904"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2010-12-06T20:13:00.513","updated":"2026-06-16T23:23:47.610","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 2.6.36 及以上版本，该版本修复了 rds_page_copy_user 函数未正确验证用户空间地址的问题。如无法立即升级内核，可通过 `modprobe -r rds` 命令卸载 RDS 内核模块，并在 `/etc/modprobe.d/` 中添加 `blacklist rds` 配置禁止自动加载，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://git.kernel.org/?p=linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux-2.6.git%3Ba=commit%3Bh=799c10559d60f159ab2232203f222f18fa3c4a5f","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2010-10/msg00008.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2010-11/msg00004.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-02/msg00000.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155751/vReliable-Datagram-Sockets-RDS-rds_page_copy_user-Privilege-Escalation.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/46397","http://securitytracker.com/id?1024613","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/362983","http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v2.6/ChangeLog-2.6.36","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0792.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0842.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/520102/100/0/threaded","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1000-1","http://www.vmware.com/security/advisories/VMSA-2011-0012.html","http://www.vsecurity.com/download/tools/linux-rds-exploit.c","http://www.vsecurity.com/resources/advisory/20101019-1/","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0298","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=642896","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44677/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2010-3904","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15285","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2010/CVE-2010-3904.md","https://github.com/SecWiki/linux-kernel-exploits/blob/2d2152cf9a58f668da720d12423e5a8a424eca3a/2010/CVE-2010-3904/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2010/CVE-2010-3904.json","https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/blob/b009dab59b57f77cede313614964625bf05fbde8/modules/exploits/linux/local/rds_rds_page_copy_user_priv_esc.rb","https://github.com/swisskyrepo/PayloadsAllTheThings/blob/c142771628ecb898b35da26d37270770e457f0e0/Methodology%20and%20Resources/Linux%20-%20Privilege%20Escalation.md","https://github.com/infinite-horizon219/Unix-Privilege-Escalation-Exploits-Pack/blob/db431bdbb5e26432d062e56abfee98cdfb5fe4c7/2010/CVE-2010-3904/15285.c","https://github.com/redstackio/redstack-vault/blob/85cd4fca816d70b450af0cac6ca430e7220f41fb/tags/CVE-2010-3904%20(RDS).md","https://github.com/l3m0n/pentest_tools/blob/d7525da7589a7eb8e3a89c7fdc4d3547af75e757/%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E6%94%BB%E9%98%B2/linux/%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%E6%8F%90%E6%9D%83/CVE-2010-3904/15285","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2010-3904","https://github.com/OlivierLaflamme/Cheatsheet-God/blob/b879fd62eaae297b38087b8227dde5f8f0cf7668/Cheatsheet_LinuxPentest.txt","https://github.com/redhatkaty/-cve-2010-3904-report"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0409.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0509","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0509.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4398","title":"Microsoft Windows win32k.sys 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows 内核 win32k.sys 的 RtlQueryRegistryValues 函数存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-787），当系统处理 SystemDefaultEUDCFont 注册表项的 REG_BINARY 数据时因未正确校验长度而覆盖内存。本地低权限用户可构造特制注册表值触发溢出，绕过 User Account Control（UAC）机制并获得 SYSTEM 级权限执行任意代码。影响 Windows XP SP2/SP3、Windows Server 2003 SP2、Windows Vista SP1/SP2、Windows Server 2008 Gold/SP2/R2 以及 Windows 7 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已通过安全更新修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4398"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2010-12-06T13:44:54.863","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:42.707","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2011 年 2 月安全更新 (MS11-011, KB2393802)，或通过 Windows Update 自动更新。若无法立即打补丁，可移除受影响系统的本地用户管理员权限组作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://isc.sans.edu/diary.html?storyid=9988","http://nakedsecurity.sophos.com/2010/11/25/new-windows-zero-day-flaw-bypasses-uac/","http://secunia.com/advisories/42356","http://support.avaya.com/css/P8/documents/100127248","http://twitter.com/msftsecresponse/statuses/7590788200402945","http://www.exploit-db.com/bypassing-uac-with-user-privilege-under-windows-vista7-mirror/","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15609/","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/529673","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/45045","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1025046","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0324","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2011/ms11-011","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A12162","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2010-4398","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15609","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2010/CVE-2010-4398.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2010-4398/README.md","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/af432ce694af9b2d5092deb1a30c46795d1006bd/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/Win32/Exploit/CVE-2010-4398.yara","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c82f217443f5e10c0c4e9bda1118e45073d229ba/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4398.json","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/Win32/CVE-2010-4398/Exploit_Win32_CVE-2010-4398.yar","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4398","https://github.com/Al1ex/WindowsElevation/blob/e8fa2760f0ea29d1cdc759c623021d5ab7b715e2/CVE-2010-4398/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/nvd_advisories/CVE-2010-4398.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2010-4398.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4398.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0509.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0109","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4282","title":"Pandora FMS 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Pandora FMS 在 3.1.1 版本之前存在多个目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 ajax.php 的 page 参数、general/pandora_help.php 的 id 参数，或 operation/agentes/networkmap.php 的 layout 参数传入包含 \"../\" 等路径遍历序列的特制请求，利用 PHP 本地文件包含机制读取、包含并执行服务器上的任意本地文件。其中 networkmap.php 的 layout 参数更可被滥用来创建、修改或删除任意本地文件。该漏洞影响所有 3.1.1 之前的 Pandora FMS 版本，攻击仅需网络访问 Web 接口即可发起，无需登录凭证，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4282"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-12-02T17:15:00.597","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:30.327","remediation":"建议立即升级 Pandora FMS 至 3.1.1 或更高版本。若暂时无法升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙配置规则拦截包含目录遍历序列（如 ../）的 page、id、layout 参数请求，并限制 ajax.php、pandora_help.php、networkmap.php 的访问权限为仅可信 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/69543","http://osvdb.org/69544","http://osvdb.org/69545","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2010/Nov/326","http://secunia.com/advisories/42347","http://sourceforge.net/projects/pandora/files/Pandora%20FMS%203.1/Final%20version%20%28Stable%29/pandorafms_console-3.1_security_patch_13Oct2010.tar.gz/download","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15643","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/514939/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/45112","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-4282.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-4282.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-4282.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2010-4282.js","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2010-4282-2001_1.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2010-4282-1999.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/cve-2010-4282-2002.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2010-4282_4.yaml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/35fe940be4a8cc841207d0ee607b7714e4ad436d/2010/CVE-2010-4282.json","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Nov/20/lfiArtifact/lfiReport.csv","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-4282_25.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2010/POC-AVE-2010-0109.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0107","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0107.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4231","title":"Camtron CMNC-200 IP 摄像机 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Camtron CMNC-200 全高清网络摄像机及 TecVoz CMNC-200 百万像素网络摄像机（固件版本 1.102A-008）的 Web 管理界面存在目录遍历漏洞。其 HTTP 服务在处理请求 URI 时未对 ../ 路径序列进行充分过滤与规范化校验，导致路径穿越防护失效。未经身份认证的远程攻击者只需向设备 80 端口发送包含 ../ 序列的特制 HTTP 请求，即可绕过目录限制读取设备文件系统上的任意文件，如配置文件、用户凭据等敏感信息。攻击仅需网络可达目标且无需登录凭证，影响上述固件版本的设备，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4231"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-11-17","updated":"2026-07-15","remediation":"由于厂商未发布正式补丁，建议在网络边界通过 ACL 限制仅授权管理 IP 访问摄像头 Web 管理端口（80/443），并使用 VLAN 隔离防止横向访问；如必须暴露 Web 界面，请在反向代理上启用 WAF 规则拦截包含 ../ 等目录遍历载荷的请求，并定期审计设备配置文件访问日志。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15505","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/514753/100/0/threaded","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-4231.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-4231.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/main/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4231.json","https://github.com/K3ysTr0K3R/CVE-2010-4231-EXPLOIT"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0107.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0406","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0406.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3333","title":"Microsoft Office RTF 解析栈缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 在处理特制 RTF 格式数据时存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于对 RTF 数据长度边界检查不足，攻击者可构造恶意 RTF 文件并诱使用户打开，进而在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Office XP SP3、Office 2003 SP3、Office 2007 SP2、Office 2010 以及多个 Mac 版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 MS10-087 安全公告中发布修复补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3333"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2010-11-10T03:00:02.087","updated":"2026-06-16T23:22:36.323","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2010 年 11 月安全公告 MS10-087 对应更新（Office 2003 对应 KB2423930，Office 2007 对应 KB2423931，Office 2010 对应 KB2423932），可通过 Windows Update 或 Microsoft Update 自动获取。临时缓解措施：启用 Microsoft Office 文件阻止策略，阻止 RTF 文件通过 Outlook 或 Office 打开；或使用 Microsoft 提供的 Fix it 自动解决方案禁用 RTF 解析功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://labs.idefense.com/intelligence/vulnerabilities/display.php?id=880","http://secunia.com/advisories/38521","http://secunia.com/advisories/42144","http://securityreason.com/securityalert/8293","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/44652","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024705","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA10-313A.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/2923","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2010/ms10-087","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A11931","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2010-3333","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/24526","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2010/CVE-2010-3333.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2010/CVE-2010-3333.json","https://github.com/firmianay/CTF-All-In-One/blob/a105064770f3454d168c2c5cf5c0763fb7d5f6e3/doc/7_exploit.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-3333","https://github.com/RedDrip7/APT_Digital_Weapon/blob/cc4cde356dcb4455419d80aedc3bba471249f167/Rover/Rover_hash.md","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/706c16a4787d37bf8dcd30da5df424ea091c303e/2010/README.md","https://github.com/decalage2/oletools/blob/ec10260989dbc48b9109e3d05d22beee19cf2333/oletools/rtfobj.py","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/carterMgj/carterMgj.github.io/blob/db88e562a18998b0e49e309933c217c8959869a2/_posts/2016-04-27-CVE-2010-3333.md","https://github.com/hanul93/kicomav/blob/bad9493528cf88fca8d52db1c0