-v2/C/CVE-2010-0219_1.yaml","https://github.com/cqr-cryeye-forks/goby-pocs/blob/ffef890592ee0c35c94a148c9f7b96b8728036d4/Axis2-Default-Credentials-Remote-Code-Execution-(CVE-2010-0219).json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e61be9425da7cd98fab7bf6d914282e65c9f9042/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-0219.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2010-0219.js","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-0219_8.yaml","https://github.com/vvts-alpha/CVE-2010-0219"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2010/POC-AVE-2010-0002.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2010/EXP-AVE-2010-0002.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0104","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0104.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3426","title":"Joomla! Jphone 组件 本地文件包含漏洞","description":"Joomla! JPhone 组件 1.0 Alpha 3 版本的 jphone.php 文件存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过 index.php 的 controller 参数传入 ../ 目录遍历序列，包含并执行服务器上的任意本地文件。该漏洞影响 Joomla! 使用 JPhone 组件 1.0 Alpha 3 版本的站点，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），属于 CWE-22 路径遍历类型。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，通过构造恶意 controller 参数实现本地文件包含，进而可能导致敏感文件读取或代码执行。ExploitDB 已公开相关利用代码。Joomla! 官方已发布更新版本修复该漏洞，建议升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3426"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-09-16T22:00:03.267","updated":"2026-06-16T23:22:44.687","remediation":"立即卸载或禁用 Joomla! 站点中已停更的 JPhone (com_jphone) 1.0 Alpha 3 组件（后台「扩展-管理」中卸载），并删除 /components/com_jphone 与 /modules 下相关文件。若必须保留，应升级到官方后续修复版本或在 jphone.php 中对 controller 参数使用 basename() 过滤并限制白名单，同时在 .htaccess 中拒绝含 \"..\" 的请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1009-exploits/joomlajphone-lfi.txt","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14964","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/43147","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/61723","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14964","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-3426.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-3426.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-3426.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2010-3426.js","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2010-3426-1992.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2010-3426-1990.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-3426_12.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-3426.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2010-3426-1992.yaml","https://github.com/justakazh/CVE_Database/blob/06bd07f32c89b43f30d59ff450dfbb661e471cbe/2010/CVE-2010-3426.json","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Nov/20/lfiArtifact/lfiReport.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0104.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0333","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0333.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2883","title":"Adobe Reader 和 Acrobat CoolType 栈缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Reader 和 Acrobat 的 CoolType.dll 字体解析引擎在处理 PDF 文档内嵌的 TTF 字体时，对 SING（Smart INdependent Glyphlets）表中的 'uniqueName' 字段缺乏长度检查，存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过构造特制的 PDF 文档（内含恶意 TTF 字体）诱导用户打开，触发缓冲区溢出，从而导致远程代码执行或应用程序崩溃。该漏洞在 2010 年 9 月已被在野利用，影响 Adobe Reader 和 Acrobat 9.4 之前版本及 8.2.5 之前版本（Windows/Mac OS X），Adobe 已发布安全更新修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2883"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2010-09-09T22:00:02.250","updated":"2026-06-16T23:21:41.330","remediation":"升级 Adobe Reader/Acrobat 至 9.4 或 8.2.5 及以上版本，禁用 PDF 阅读器中的内嵌字体解析功能，或使用替代 PDF 阅读器（如 Foxit Reader）打开可疑 PDF 文件，在 Web 网关层过滤含异常 TTF 字体的 PDF 附件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.metasploit.com/2010/09/return-of-unpublished-adobe.html","http://community.websense.com/blogs/securitylabs/archive/2010/09/10/brief-analysis-on-adobe-reader-sing-table-parsing-vulnerability-cve-2010-2883.aspx","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2010-10/msg00001.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2010-10/msg00006.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/41340","http://secunia.com/advisories/43025","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201101-08.xml","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/advisories/apsa10-02.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb10-21.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/491991","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0743.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/43057","http://www.turbolinux.co.jp/security/2011/TLSA-2011-2j.txt","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA10-279A.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/2331","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0191","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0344","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/61635","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A11586","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2010-2883","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16494","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2010/CVE-2010-2883.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2010/CVE-2010-2883.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/473b5b7ab67fbfca95e1b7287ebb22343d9a57e4/data/2010/CVE-2010-2883-avielzecharia_CVE-2010-2883.md","https://github.com/CrackerCat/simpread/blob/1ec36a5827997f39a7a815e20121b12f8d781497/md/[%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%9B]%20%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%AF%94%E6%88%91%E6%9B%B4%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%20CVE-2010-2883%20%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E4%BA%86.md","https://github.com/firmianay/CTF-All-In-One/blob/a105064770f3454d168c2c5cf5c0763fb7d5f6e3/doc/7_exploit.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-2883","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2883.json","https://github.com/jesparza/peepdf/blob/c74dc65c0ac7e506bae4f2582a2435ec50741f40/CHANGELOG","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/706c16a4787d37bf8dcd30da5df424ea091c303e/2010/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/nvd_advisories/CVE-2010-2883.txt","https://github.com/avielzecharia/CVE-2010-2883"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0333.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0103","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0103.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3203","title":"Joomla! PicSell 组件 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 PicSell（com_picsell）组件 1.0 版本存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。该组件在处理 index.php 的 prevsell dwnfree 动作时，未对 dflink 参数进行充分的路径过滤与校验，攻击者可构造包含 \"../\"（点-点-斜杠）序列的恶意参数值，突破 Web 根目录限制，实现任意文件读取。未经身份认证的远程攻击者只需向目标站点发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可触发该漏洞，从而读取服务器上的敏感文件（如配置文件、源码、口令文件等），可能导致信息泄露乃至进一步渗透。受影响范围为安装了 PicSell 1.0 组件且未打补丁的 Joomla! 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3203"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-09-03T18:00:02.577","updated":"2026-06-16T23:22:22.070","remediation":"建议立即升级 Joomla! 至 1.5.22 或更高版本，并卸载或禁用 PicSell (com_picsell) 1.0 组件；若无法升级，请在 Web 应用防火墙配置规则拦截包含 ../ 的 dflink 参数请求，并限制 Web 服务器进程对敏感目录的读取权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/41187","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14845","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14845","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-3203.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-3203.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-3203.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb86e46de27f177abd11211a1c508ec72b4b0dea/cves/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3203.json","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2010-3203-1988.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2010-3203-1986_3.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-3203_6.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3203.json","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Jan/22/Reports/Report.csv","https://github.com/gongzeq/VAPT3/blob/3576a7accf5cbadc8e64924d6ff48393db379ea7/secbot/resource/poc/cve/cve-2010-3203-1986.yaml","https://github.com/abh2technology/abh2-custom-templates-nucleiengine/blob/c7ba146f8016161974a9cf9f812ae7f225d23065/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-3203.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0103.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0400","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0400.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3035","title":"Cisco IOS XR BGP 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS XR 3.4.0 至 3.9.1 版本在启用 BGP 协议时，未能正确处理无法识别的传递属性（transitive attribute）。远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 BGP 前缀通告（包含属性类型代码 99）触发该漏洞，导致 BGP 对等会话重置，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行 Cisco IOS XR 的多种路由设备，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Cisco 已发布安全公告修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3035"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2010-08-30T21:00:12.203","updated":"2026-06-16T23:22:00.630","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS XR 至 3.9.2 或更高版本（该版本包含 CSCti62211 的修复补丁）；在无法立即升级时，可在 BGP 入口策略中配置 route-map 丢弃属性类型码 99 的更新，或使用 `neighbor x.x.x.x filter-list` 配合前缀列表过滤异常 BGP 通告，同时启用 BGP 会话 MD5 认证和 TTL 安全跳数限制缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://mailman.nanog.org/pipermail/nanog/2010-August/024837.html","http://osvdb.org/67696","http://secunia.com/advisories/41190","http://www.cisco.com/en/US/products/products_security_advisory09186a0080b4411f.shtml","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024371","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/2227","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/61443","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2010-3035","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2010/CVE-2010-3035.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3035.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-3035","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3e6800281dab3089a8374b9fe419c8b8110ea36/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3035.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2010-3035.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2010-3035.html","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2010.txt","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/730547e3121e93fb4d300346c9d4aa5d5b39b4fc/data_single/2010/CVE-2010-3035.csv","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2010/CVE-2010-3035.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0400.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0119","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0119.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-0120","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer QCP 音频解析堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 11.0 至 11.1 及 RealPlayer SP 1.0 至 1.1.4 在 Windows 平台上处理 QCP 音频内容时存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造包含超大尺寸值的恶意 QCP 音频文件，诱导用户播放触发堆溢出，进而在用户上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows 平台上的 RealPlayer 多个版本，CVSS 评分 9.3（AV:N/AC:M/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度中等、无需身份认证、机密性/完整性/可用性均完全受损。攻击者需诱导受害者打开恶意 QCP 文件或访问嵌入恶意 QCP 内容的网页，利用方式为构造畸形 QCP 文件触发堆溢出实现远程代码执行。RealNetworks 已在 RealPlayer SP 12.0.0.879 及更高版本中修复该漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-0120"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-08-30T20:00:01.920","updated":"2026-06-16T23:15:31.020","remediation":"建议立即升级 RealPlayer 至 SP 12.0.0.879 或更高版本（官网下载最新版）。若暂时无法升级，建议在浏览器中禁用 RealPlayer ActiveX 插件（IE 管理加载项中禁用 RealPlayer Browser Record Plugin 等），并禁止打开不可信的 .qcp 文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/41096","http://secunia.com/advisories/41154","http://secunia.com/secunia_research/2010-8/","http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/08262010_player/en/","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024370","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/2216","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/61422","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A6807","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2010/0xxx/CVE-2010-0120.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-0120","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2010-0120.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-0120.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-9h27-8cv4-44j6/GHSA-9h27-8cv4-44j6.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_realplayer_mult_vuln_win.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_112700_112800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--78d25e8c-2881-4946-a455-2da0f833efd4.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-0120.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0119.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0118","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0118.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-0117","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer MP4 YUV420 转换远程代码执行漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 11.0-11.1 及 RealPlayer SP 1.0-1.1.4 (Windows版) 在处理 MP4 内容的 YUV420 色彩空间转换时，未正确校验视频帧维度参数，导致整数溢出进而触发堆缓冲区溢出。远程攻击者可构造恶意 MP4 文件，诱导用户使用受影响版本 RealPlayer 打开，触发漏洞在用户上下文中执行任意代码 (CVSS 9.3，AV:N/AC:M/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C)。受影响版本为 RealPlayer 11.0 至 11.1 及 RealPlayer SP 1.0 至 1.1.4，RealPlayer SP 12.0.0.879 及以上版本已修复。攻击需用户交互 (打开恶意文件)，攻击复杂度中等，成功利用可完全控制受害系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-0117"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-08-30T20:00:01.873","updated":"2026-06-16T23:15:30.663","remediation":"立即卸载RealPlayer并改用当前支持的媒体播放器（如VLC、MPC-HC等），彻底消除漏洞影响。如必须继续使用RealPlayer，请升级到最新官方版本（12.0.0.879及以上），并仅从可信来源打开MP4文件，同时在防火墙中封锁所有RealPlayer协议处理相关端口作为网络层防护。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/41096","http://secunia.com/advisories/41154","http://secunia.com/secunia_research/2010-5/","http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/08262010_player/en/","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024370","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/2216","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/61421","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A7169","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2010/0xxx/CVE-2010-0117.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-0117","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2010-0117.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-0117.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-7jr7-p2g8-6cfq/GHSA-7jr7-p2g8-6cfq.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_realplayer_mult_vuln_win.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_112700_112800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--76b8b4b1-80a9-4394-b